  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Punjab Education Support Programme II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased enrollment and improved learning outcomes, including literacy and numeracy, for girls and the most marginalized in primary and secondary schools of Punjab Province in Pakistan. All government school children (6 million primary, 4 million secondary) and children attending school through the Punjab Education Foundation (around 2.2 million), including 50% girls, will have benefited from UK support in Punjab by March 2021.</narrative>
  </description>
